cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release and the associated article."
type: software
title: "DQN-ES: simulation and analysis code for Deep Q-Network Candidate Restriction and Acuity Leakage in Privacy-Aware Healthcare IoT Task Offloading"
abstract: "Event-driven simulator of task offloading from IoMT wearables to edge, fog and cloud nodes, with the DQN-ES scheduler (DQN top-K candidate restriction followed by exhaustive enumeration over the K candidates), per-task and random-restriction baselines, an entropy-reweighted greedy frontier, a criticality-agnostic static rule, a learned acuity-inference adversary, paired statistics and run manifests."
version: "v2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-02"
